      ******************************************************************        
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.                                                    
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.                                                   
       SPECIAL-NAMES.                                                           
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.                                              
      ******************************************************************        
      *                  DATA DIVISION                                 *        
      ******************************************************************        
       DATA DIVISION.                                                           
      ******************************************************************        
      *                  WORKING-STORAGE SECTION                       *        
      ******************************************************************        
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.                                                 
      *                                                                         
       01 XN-INDICES.                                                           
          03 XN-I                      PIC 99 VALUE ZEROES.                     
          03 XN-J                      PIC 99 VALUE ZEROES.                     
          03 XN-A                      PIC 99 VALUE ZEROES.                     
          03 XN-B                      PIC 99 VALUE ZEROES.                     
      *MU-2017-BDGI-V-R-INI                                                     
          03 XN-M                      PIC 99 VALUE ZEROES.                     
      *MU-2017-BDGI-V-R-FIN                                                     

       01 WS-VARIABLES.                                                         
          03 WS-X372M004.                                                       
             COPY X372M004.                                                     

          03 WS-DATOS.                                                          
             05 WS-ANIO            PIC 9(4).                                    
             05 WS-KEXPEDIENTE     PIC 9(10).                                   
             05 WS-CMODO           PIC X(2).                                    

          03 CN-CONSTANTES.                                                     
             05 CN-RES-MAX            PIC 9(2) VALUE 20.                        

      *   CONTROL DE ERRORES DEL PROGRAMA                                       
       01 SW-SWITCH.                                                            
          03 SW-ERRORES                PIC XX VALUE '00'.                       
             88 NO-ERROR                      VALUE '00'.                       
             88 ERROR-GRAVE                   VALUE '01'.                       

          03 SW-INCIDENCIA             PIC X VALUE 'N'.                         
             88 SW-NO-INCIDENCIA             VALUE 'N'.                         
             88 SW-SI-INCIDENCIA             VALUE 'S'.                         

          03 SW-PRIMERO                PIC X VALUE 'S'.                         
             88 SW-SI-PRIMERO                VALUE 'S'.                         
             88 SW-NO-PRIMERO                VALUE 'N'.                         

      *MODULOS                                                                  
       01 WS-MODULOS.                                                           
          03 WS-B372M004               PIC X(8) VALUE 'B372M004'.               

       01 LT-LITERALES.                                                         
          03 WS-FECHA-ACTUAL.                                                   
             05 WS-FECHA.                                                       
                07 WS-ANO                   PIC 9(04).                          
                07 WS-MES                   PIC 9(02).                          
                07 WS-DIA                   PIC 9(02).                          
             05 WS-TIEMPO.                                                      
                07 WS-HORA                  PIC 9(02).                          
                07 WS-MINUTOS               PIC 9(02).                          
                07 WS-SEGUNDOS              PIC 9(02).                          
                07 WS-CENTESIMAS            PIC 9(02).                          
          03 LT-RETURN-OK              PIC X(2) VALUE '00'.                     
          03 LT-NO-OPER                PIC X(2) VALUE '01'.                     
          03 LT-NO-ANIO                PIC X(2) VALUE '02'.                     
          03 LT-NO-EXPE                PIC X(2) VALUE '03'.                     
          03 LT-NO-POLIZ               PIC X(2) VALUE '04'.                     
          03 LT-NO-NIF                 PIC X(2) VALUE '05'.                     
          03 LT-ERROR-LLAM             PIC X(2) VALUE '06'.                     
      ******************************************************************        
       LINKAGE SECTION.                                                         
      ******************************************************************        
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.                                                          
           COPY X372VT04.                                                       
      *************************************************************             
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DFHCOMMAREA.                                    
      *************************************************************             
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO.                                                 
           PERFORM 2000-PROCESO.                                                
           PERFORM 10000-FIN.                                                   
      ********************************************************                  
       1000-INICIO.                                                             
      ********************************************************                  
      * INICIALIZAR VARIABLES                                                   
      ********************************************************                  
           INITIALIZE XN-INDICES.                                               
           INITIALIZE WS-DATOS.                                                 
           INITIALIZE WS-X372M004.                                              
           INITIALIZE X372VT04-NUM-REGISTROS-S.                                 
           MOVE 'S'  TO X372VT04-SPAGINACION-S.                                 
           MOVE 'N'  TO X372M004-SPAGINACION-S.                                 
           MOVE LT-RETURN-OK TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S OF DFHCOMMAREA.             
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-FECHA-ACTUAL                        
            .                                                                   
      ***************************************************************           
       2000-PROCESO.                                                            
      ***************************************************************           
           IF X372VT04-OPERACION-E NOT = SPACES                                 
              PERFORM 2200-REALIZAR-OPERACIONES                                 
           ELSE                                                                 
              SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                          
              MOVE LT-NO-OPER  TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                           
              MOVE 'LA OPERACION NO ESTA INFORMADA'                             
                               TO X372VT04-GERROR-S                             
              MOVE 'B372N004'  TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                           
           END-IF                                                               

           IF X372VT04-OPERACION-E = 'CI'                                       
              MOVE 1   TO X372VT04-NUM-REGISTROS-S                              
           END-IF.                                                              


      ***************************************************************           
       2200-REALIZAR-OPERACIONES.                                               
      ***************************************************************           
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' OPERACION-YACO ' X372VT04-OPERACION-E                      
      *F*                                                                       
           IF X372VT04-OPERACION-E NOT = 'LI'                                   

              PERFORM 2050-VALIDAR-ENTRADA                                      

              IF X372VT04-OPERACION-E = 'LP' AND SW-NO-INCIDENCIA               

                 PERFORM 2040-VALIDAR-OPERACION                                 

              END-IF                                                            

           ELSE                                                                 

              MOVE 'LI'        TO WS-CMODO                                      
              MOVE ZEROES      TO X372M004-ANIO-E                               
              MOVE ZEROES      TO X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-E                        

           END-IF.                                                              


           IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                   

              EVALUATE WS-CMODO                                                 

                  WHEN 'CI'                                                     

                     PERFORM 2100-MOVER-DATOS-ENTRADA                           

                     CALL WS-B372M004 USING WS-X372M004                         

                     IF X372M004-CRETORNO-S OF WS-X372M004 = '00'               
                        PERFORM 2300-MOVER-SALIDA                               
                     ELSE                                                       
                        SET  ERROR-GRAVE         TO TRUE                        
                        MOVE LT-ERROR-LLAM       TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S         
                        MOVE X372M004-GERROR-S   TO X372VT04-GERROR-S           
                        MOVE X372M004-GNOMPROG-S TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S         
                     END-IF                                                     

                  WHEN 'LI'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LA'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LE'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LP'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LS'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LC'                                                     
                  WHEN 'LN'                                                     
                  WHEN 'L0'                                                     

                     SET SW-SI-PRIMERO TO TRUE                                  

                     MOVE ZEROES TO XN-I                                        
                     PERFORM UNTIL X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'S'                 
                               OR X372VT04-SPAGINACION-S = 'N'                  
                               OR X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S  > CN-RES-MAX        
                               OR XN-I > CN-RES-MAX                             
                               OR XN-I > X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S               
                               OR ERROR-GRAVE                                   

                        IF SW-SI-PRIMERO                                        
                           PERFORM 2100-MOVER-DATOS-ENTRADA                     
                           SET SW-NO-PRIMERO TO TRUE                            
                        ELSE                                                    
                           PERFORM 2150-MOVER-ENTRADA-LISTADO                   
                        END-IF                                                  

                        CALL WS-B372M004 USING WS-X372M004                      
      *D*                                                                       
      *         DISPLAY 'RETORNO M004 ' X372M004-CRETORNO-S                     
      *F*                                                                       
                        IF X372M004-CRETORNO-S  = '00'                     ROES 
                           PERFORM 2350-MOVER-LISTADO                           
                        ELSE                                                    
                           SET ERROR-GRAVE        TO TRUE                       
                           MOVE LT-ERROR-LLAM     TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S        
                           MOVE X372M004-GERROR-S TO X372VT04-GERROR-S          
                           MOVE X372M004-GNOMPROG-S                             
                                                  TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S        
                        END-IF                                                  

                     END-PERFORM                                                

                  WHEN OTHER                                                    
                     SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                   
                     MOVE LT-NO-OPER  TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                    
                     MOVE 'EL CAMPO MODO DE ENTRADA NO ESTA INFORMADO'          
                                      TO X372VT04-GERROR-S                      
                     MOVE 'B372N004'  TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                    
              END-EVALUATE                                                      
           END-IF.                                                              

      ***************************************************************           
       2040-VALIDAR-OPERACION.                                                  
      ***************************************************************           
           IF X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E NOT EQUAL TO ZEROS                        
           AND X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E NOT EQUAL TO ZEROS                         
                 MOVE 'LC' TO WS-CMODO                                          
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' ENTRAMOS EN ERTIFICADO '                                   
      *F*                                                                       
           END-IF                                                               

           IF X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E NOT EQUAL TO ZEROS                          
           AND X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E EQUAL TO ZEROS                           
                 MOVE 'LS' TO WS-CMODO                                          
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' ENTRAMOS EN SUBPOLIZA '                                    
      *F*                                                                       
           END-IF                                                               

           IF X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E EQUAL TO ZEROS                              
           AND X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E EQUAL TO ZEROS                           
                 MOVE 'LP' TO WS-CMODO                                          
           END-IF.                                                              
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: ENTRAMOS EN ESTADO'                               
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: SUBPOL :' X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E                   
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: CERTIF :' X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E                 
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: POLIZA :' X372VT04-KPOLIZA-E                      
      *F*                                                                       

           IF  X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E EQUAL TO ZEROS                             
           AND X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E EQUAL TO ZEROS                           
           AND X372VT04-KPOLIZA-E      EQUAL TO ZEROS                           
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: ENTRAMOS EN ESTADO'                               
      *    DISPLAY 'B372N004: ESTADO :' X372VT04-STIPSITUACION-E                
      *F*                                                                       
                 MOVE 'L0' TO WS-CMODO                                          
           END-IF.                                                              
      ***************************************************************           
       2050-VALIDAR-ENTRADA.                                                    
      ***************************************************************           
           SET  SW-NO-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE.                                       

           EVALUATE X372VT04-OPERACION-E                                        

           WHEN 'LA'                                                            

              IF X372VT04-ANIO-E   NOT = ZEROES                                 
                 MOVE 'LA' TO WS-CMODO                                          
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-NO-ANIO       TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                   
                 SET  SW-SI-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE                                  
                 MOVE 'B372N004'       TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                   
              END-IF                                                            

           WHEN 'LE'                                                            

              IF X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-E   NOT = ZEROES                          
                 MOVE 'LE' TO WS-CMODO                                          
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-NO-EXPE       TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                   
                 SET  SW-SI-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE                                  
                 MOVE 'B372N004'       TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                   
              END-IF                                                            

           WHEN 'LP'                                                            
      *D*                                                                       
      *     DISPLAY ' VALIDACIONES LP '                                         
      *     DISPLAY ' POLIZA          ' X372VT04-KPOLIZA-E                      
      *     DISPLAY ' SITUACION       ' X372VT04-STIPSITUACION-E                
      *F*                                                                       

              IF X372VT04-KPOLIZA-E  NOT EQUAL SPACES                           
                 MOVE 'LP' TO WS-CMODO                                          
              ELSE                                                              
                 IF X372VT04-STIPSITUACION-E NOT EQUAL SPACES                   
                    MOVE 'LE' TO WS-CMODO                                       
                 ELSE                                                           
                    MOVE LT-NO-POLIZ      TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                
                    SET  SW-SI-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE                               
                    MOVE 'B372N004'       TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                
                 END-IF                                                         
              END-IF                                                            

           WHEN 'LN'                                                            

              IF X372VT04-NIF-E  NOT EQUAL SPACES                               
                 MOVE 'LN' TO WS-CMODO                                          
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-NO-NIF        TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                   
                 SET  SW-SI-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE                                  
                 MOVE 'B372N004'       TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                   
              END-IF                                                            

           WHEN 'CI'                                                            

              IF X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-E NOT EQUAL ZEROES AND                    
                 X372VT04-ANIO-E        NOT EQUAL ZEROES                        
                 MOVE 'CI' TO WS-CMODO                                          
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-NO-POLIZ      TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                   
                 SET  SW-SI-INCIDENCIA TO TRUE                                  
                 MOVE 'B372N004'       TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                   
              END-IF                                                            

           WHEN OTHER                                                           

              SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                          
              MOVE LT-NO-OPER  TO X372VT04-CRETORNO-S                           
              MOVE 'LA OPERACION DE ENTRADA NO ES VALIDO'                       
                               TO X372VT04-GERROR-S                             
              MOVE 'B372N004'  TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                           
           END-EVALUATE                                                         

           IF SW-SI-INCIDENCIA                                                  

              SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                          
              MOVE 'LOS PARAMETROS DE ENTRADA SON INCORRECTOS'                  
                               TO X372VT04-GERROR-S                             
              MOVE 'B372N004'  TO X372VT04-GNOMPROG-S                           
           END-IF.                                                              

      ***************************************************************           
       2100-MOVER-DATOS-ENTRADA.                                                
      ***************************************************************           
           INITIALIZE WS-X372M004.                                              
           MOVE WS-CMODO                TO X372M004-OPERACION-E                 
           MOVE X372VT04-ANIO-E         TO X372M004-ANIO-E                      
           MOVE X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-E  TO X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-E               
           MOVE X372VT04-KPOLIZA-E      TO X372M004-KPOLIZA-E                   
           MOVE X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-E   TO X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E                
           MOVE X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-E TO X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E              
           MOVE X372VT04-STIPSITUACION-E TO X372M004-STIPSITUACION-E            
           MOVE X372VT04-NIF-E          TO X372M004-NIF-E                       
           MOVE X372VT04-ANT-ANIO-E     TO X372M004-ANT-ANIO-E                  
           MOVE X372VT04-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E                                      
                                        TO X372M004-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E           
      *D*                                                                       
      *    DISPLAY ' MODO ' X372M004-OPERACION-E                                
      *    DISPLAY ' POLIZA ' X372M004-KPOLIZA-E                                
      *    DISPLAY ' SUBPOL ' X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E                             
      *    DISPLAY ' CERTIF ' X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E                           
      *F*                                                                       
           .                                                                    
      ***************************************************************           
       2150-MOVER-ENTRADA-LISTADO.                                              
      ***************************************************************           

           MOVE WS-CMODO                     TO X372M004-OPERACION-E            
           MOVE X372VT04-ANIO-S       (XN-I) TO X372M004-ANIO-E                 
           MOVE X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-I) TO X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-E          
           MOVE X372VT04-KPOLIZA-S    (XN-I) TO X372M004-KPOLIZA-E              
           MOVE X372VT04-NSUBPOLIZA-S (XN-I) TO X372M004-NSUBPOLIZA-E           
           MOVE X372VT04-KCERTIFICADO-S (XN-I)                                  
                                             TO X372M004-KCERTIFICADO-E         
           MOVE X372VT04-NIF1-S       (XN-I) TO X372M004-NIF-E                  


           IF X372M004-SPAGINACION-S = 'S'                                      
              MOVE X372VT04-ANIO-S          (XN-I)                              
                TO X372M004-ANT-ANIO-E                                          
              MOVE X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-S   (XN-I)                              
                TO X372M004-ANT-KEXPEDIENTE-E                                   
           END-IF                                                               
           .                                                                    
      ***************************************************************           
       2300-MOVER-SALIDA.                                                       
      ***************************************************************           
           IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                   

              MOVE X372M004-SPAGINACION-S                                       
                TO X372VT04-SPAGINACION-S                                       
              MOVE X372M004-PRO-ANIO-S                                          
                TO X372VT04-PRO-ANIO-S                                          
              MOVE X372M004-PRO-KEXPEDIENTE-S                                   
                TO X372VT04-PRO-KEXPEDIENTE-S                                   
              MOVE X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S                                     
                TO X372VT04-NUM-REGISTROS-S                                     

              PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1                                  
                        UNTIL XN-J > X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S                   
                           OR XN-J > CN-RES-MAX                                 
                           OR ERROR-GRAVE                                       

                 MOVE XN-J TO XN-A                                              
                 MOVE XN-J TO XN-B                                              

                 PERFORM 2700-MOVER-OCCUR                                       

              END-PERFORM                                                       

           END-IF.                                                              

      *****************************************************************         
       2350-MOVER-LISTADO.                                                      
      *****************************************************************         
           IF X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S > ZEROES                                 

              IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                

                 ADD 1 TO XN-I                                                  

                 MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S      (1)                                  
                   TO WS-ANIO                                                   
                 MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(1)                                 
                   TO WS-KEXPEDIENTE                                            

                 MOVE 1    TO XN-A                                              
                 MOVE XN-I TO XN-B                                              

                 PERFORM 2700-MOVER-OCCUR                                       

                 PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1                               
                           UNTIL XN-J > X372M004-NUM-REGISTROS-S                
                              OR XN-I >= CN-RES-MAX                             
                              OR ERROR-GRAVE                                    

                   IF X372M004-ANIO-S           (XN-J)     = WS-ANIO            

                      IF X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S (XN-J) >                        
                         WS-KEXPEDIENTE                                         

                         ADD 1 TO XN-I                                          
                         MOVE XN-J TO XN-A                                      
                         MOVE XN-I TO XN-B                                      

                         PERFORM 2700-MOVER-OCCUR                               

                      END-IF                                                    

                   ELSE                                                         

                      ADD 1 TO XN-I                                             
                      MOVE XN-J TO XN-A                                         
                      MOVE XN-I TO XN-B                                         

                      PERFORM 2700-MOVER-OCCUR                                  

                   END-IF                                                       

                   MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S      (XN-J)                             
                     TO WS-ANIO                                                 
                   MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-J)                            
                     TO WS-KEXPEDIENTE                                          

                 END-PERFORM                                                    

      *** CONTROLAMOS SI HAY PAGINACION                                         

                IF XN-I >= CN-RES-MAX                                           
                   MOVE 'S'                                                     
                     TO X372VT04-SPAGINACION-S                                  
                   MOVE X372VT04-ANIO-S         (XN-I)                          
                     TO X372VT04-PRO-ANIO-S                                     
                   MOVE X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-S  (XN-I)                          
                     TO X372VT04-PRO-KEXPEDIENTE-S                              
                ELSE                                                            
                   MOVE 'N'                                                     
                     TO X372VT04-SPAGINACION-S                                  
                END-IF                                                          

                MOVE XN-I TO X372VT04-NUM-REGISTROS-S                           

              END-IF                                                            

           END-IF.                                                              

      ****************************************************************          
       2700-MOVER-OCCUR.                                                        
      ****************************************************************          
           MOVE X372M004-ANIO-S(XN-A)                                           
             TO X372VT04-ANIO-S(XN-B)                                           
           MOVE X372M004-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-A)                                    
             TO X372VT04-KEXPEDIENTE-S(XN-B)                                    
           MOVE X372M004-KRAMO-S(XN-A)                                          
             TO X372VT04-KRAMO-S(XN-B)                                          
           MOVE X372M004-ANIOPOL-S(XN-A)                                        
             TO X372VT04-ANIOPOL-S(XN-B)                                        
           MOVE X372M004-KPOLIZA-S(XN-A)                                        
             TO X372VT04-KPOLIZA-S(XN-B)                                        
